  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 10540,
      "text": "Activity 3. Listen to the conversation and complete the ideas. Then match the ideas to the people."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12280,
      "end_ms": 20680,
      "text": "Mark, come here please. Did you hear the news? Let's celebrate Christmas in a new way this year."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 21280,
      "end_ms": 23160,
      "text": "What are we going to do?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 23160,
      "end_ms": 30220,
      "text": "Well, let's not have a big meal. We don't want to waste food."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 31000,
      "end_ms": 35520,
      "text": "Okay, but can we still have a Christmas cake?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 36440,
      "end_ms": 40000,
      "text": "No problem. I know you love it."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 40660,
      "end_ms": 44540,
      "text": "And this year we won't have a Christmas tree."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 45320,
      "end_ms": 50740,
      "text": "I don't agree. A tree is really important at Christmas."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 50740,
      "end_ms": 56120,
      "text": "us. All right, let's make a tree from old boxes."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 57020,
      "end_ms": 65760,
      "text": "Maybe we can draw a tree on the wall. I'm not sure about that. How about using the"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 65760,
      "end_ms": 71200,
      "text": "big plant in the living room? There won't be any waste or pollution."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 72580,
      "end_ms": 77120,
      "text": "Great idea. By the way, will I still have gifts?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 77120,
      "end_ms": 84260,
      "text": "Yes, of course! But we'll wrap the gifts in old newspapers."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 84980,
      "end_ms": 90200,
      "text": "That's okay, but please use beautiful newspapers."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 98900,
      "end_ms": 105360,
      "text": "Listen again. Then talk about how the speakers agree and disagree."
    },
